---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Reservations" description="Reserve a seat at Sushi BBY's omakase experience.">
  <section class="res-simple">
    <div class="res-simple-inner">
      <h1>Reservations</h1>
      <p class="res-brand">SUSHI BBY</p>

      <p>
        Our menu is composed of raw fish and rice. We do not provide vegan
        options or options without rice or without fish.
      </p>

      <div class="res-seating">
        <p><strong>Seating</strong></p>
        <p>Tuesday–Thursday: 6:00 pm, 8:00 pm</p>
        <p>Friday–Saturday: 5:00 pm, 7:00 pm, 9:00 pm</p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Each experience is 1 hr 45 minutes so prompt timing is essential.
        We have a 10-minute grace period. The full Omakase experience cannot
        be guaranteed for late arrivals.
      </p>

      <p>
        We serve <strong>OMAKASE for $220</strong> plus tax.
      </p>

      <p>
        If the reservation is cancelled 24 hours prior to the actual visit or
        later, 100% is charged per person. This includes any circumstance
        including COVID-related situations.
      </p>

      <p>
        Reservations can be made on <strong>OpenTable</strong>.
        For more information, please email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:contact@sushi-bby.com">contact@sushi-bby.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .res-simple {
    padding: 5rem var(--pad-x);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .res-simple-inner {
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .res-simple-inner h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .res-brand {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
  }

  .res-seating {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .res-simple-inner p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .res-simple-inner a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
